# LF in every checkout, on every OS. The Rust tests embed fixtures byte for
# byte (`include_str!` of tests/fixtures/*.xml and *.json), and Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would hand them CRLF: the feed and
# listing parsers' tests then fail on Windows only. This replaces the
# `git config core.autocrlf false` the release workflow ran before checkout,
# and covers a Windows clone as well. Binary files are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
